<article class="page">
  <h1 class="page__title">About</h1>
  <div class="page__body">
    <p><em>Outside the Boxplot</em> is a digital garden for thinking out loud about data communication.</p>

    <p>I work at the intersection of data and storytelling — helping people understand what numbers mean, why it matters, and how to make that meaning legible to others. That means a lot of time thinking about charts, words, structure, and the gap between insight and communication.</p>

    <p>This site is where I work through those thoughts. The categories signal what kind of thinking each post represents:</p>
  </div>

